  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0d822886221c0364b9fc056e41f01c23, type: 3}
  m_Name: 5_ResearchRoom
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Tutorial
  ID: 4
  Message:
  - '<color=#C25CFF>Research Room</color> has a purple panel where you can research
    new technology and rocket parts. '
  - Every research requires some resources and research points, You can see your
    current research points at the top of the screen with the <b>Magnifying Glass
    Icon</b>
  - Research Points can be gathered by processing Alien Artifacts ( <sprite=0> )
    which can be found by mining Alien Ruins ( <sprite=1> )
